Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.10,0:01:04.08,ПРЕДСТ,,0,0,0,,ФАНСАБ-ГРУППА АЗАЛИИ ПРЕДСТАВЛЯЕТ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.10,0:01:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fade(00,0)\p1\a5\bord0\1a&H00&\pos(430,206)\fscx807\fscy277}m 0 0 l 0 0 l 92 0 l 92 38 l 0 38
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.10,0:01:04.08,worked,,0,0,0,,{\pos(801,256)}Worked on the series:\N Lily, Tiramisu, Biryulka, Host, Pineapple
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.10,0:01:04.08,title,,0,0,0,,{\fscx75\fscy75\pos(846,392)}How I became
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.10,0:01:04.08,name,,0,0,0,,{\fscx75\fscy75\pos(848,456)}queen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.16,2:01:37.16,PRESENT,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(1181,4)}AZALEA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.19,0:01:06.63,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,All characters are fictitious,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.63,0:01:08.90,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,and the events shown are fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.46,0:01:13.30,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Final episode
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.82,0:01:14.96,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.03,0:01:21.44,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Search.\N-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.15,0:01:39.58,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Nothing suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.80,0:02:20.93,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Profit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.68,0:02:32.41,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Carefully search all the carts with royal gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.85,0:02:33.91,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.58,0:02:44.82,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty!\N-Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.66,0:02:46.69,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,How...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.78,0:02:49.83,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,King!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.63,0:02:56.24,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Finally, I caught this little rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.16,0:02:58.61,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,When does the ceremony start?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.30,0:03:01.80,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Afternoon.\N-So we have some time?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.21,0:03:04.53,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,You can’t relax. Let's hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.27,0:03:06.34,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.34,0:03:14.79,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-What was that?\N-I don’t know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.99,0:03:23.99,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,We have time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.52,0:03:26.89,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Now let's go.\N-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.77,0:03:38.68,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,My life without me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.23,0:04:02.30,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.48,0:04:13.51,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Wait, I haven't finished cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.58,0:04:18.58,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Oh, mommies!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.21,0:04:25.26,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.23,0:04:29.73,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,You are so offended,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.15,0:04:32.73,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,what is your soul wandering around the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.20,0:04:36.46,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.01,0:04:41.04,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Chief Eunuch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.21,0:04:43.71,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.71,0:04:46.87,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,With you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.51,0:04:49.24,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.89,0:04:55.71,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, go to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.31,0:04:58.15,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,You must come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.79,0:05:00.86,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.86,0:05:03.89,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,King.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.33,0:05:07.12,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Your Majesty! You are alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.46,0:05:12.80,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, what happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.66,0:05:35.69,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,It goes well with royal attire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.99,0:05:37.86,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I have amazing taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.60,0:05:42.60,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.68,0:05:50.74,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.38,0:06:04.68,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Creeping reptile.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.93,0:06:13.17,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.19,0:06:15.74,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Why are you so good?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.93,0:06:19.47,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Maybe this is a vibe born of experience?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.97,0:06:21.93,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Born from experience what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.93,0:06:23.78,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I'm amazing with knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.28,0:06:32.92,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Don’t make useless movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.42,0:06:35.59,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,How many warriors are guarding the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.53,0:06:41.55,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,You are late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.82,0:06:43.75,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,This sound means the beginning of the coronation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.60,0:06:47.49,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,How dare you dare me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.28,0:07:00.07,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Has the coronation ceremony started yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.28,0:07:06.22,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Bow respectfully
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.25,0:07:11.01,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,four times
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.67,0:07:28.56,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,and sit up straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.44,0:07:36.98,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I can’t believe they started earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.68,0:07:42.25,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Hey, I need to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.01,0:07:46.55,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I have a backup plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.95,0:08:21.82,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Hurry up and continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.73,0:08:23.82,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,The thing is,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.99,0:08:28.49,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,that the royal seal is missing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.68,0:08:37.57,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,No Royal Seal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.12,0:09:01.60,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I must be crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.36,0:09:05.93,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Or lost his head because this is a special task.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.24,0:09:10.63,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Raise your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.34,0:09:14.68,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Greetings, your...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.51,0:09:18.51,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.24,0:09:22.49,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Lee Senman.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.79,0:09:25.93,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,You're Lee Senman.\NAre you completely crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.43,0:09:27.68,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Or am I nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.56,0:09:34.17,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Have you stolen the royal seal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.96,0:09:36.46,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I'm a little crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.27,0:09:39.27,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,So we still have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.57,0:09:53.44,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,-Let's go.\N-Forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.22,0:10:02.05,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Last time it worked for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.05,0:10:04.00,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,-Try.\N-Hush.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.03,0:10:05.46,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Why are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.59,0:10:11.73,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.73,0:10:16.97,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,You again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.97,0:10:18.41,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I told you not to come!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.54,0:10:19.75,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Just for me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.25,0:10:22.71,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,no one else to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.68,0:10:30.89,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,The Queen asked me to steal something for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.87,0:10:42.83,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,This bright and expensive item
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.83,0:10:44.83,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,looks ominous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.00,0:10:46.17,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.83,0:10:49.60,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Royal Seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.54,0:10:51.54,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Are you thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.91,0:10:55.28,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,where did you show up with a stolen seal?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.38,0:10:56.68,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,This is the Detective Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.02,0:11:04.29,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Did I come to prison voluntarily?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.90,0:11:10.09,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Why are you giving it to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.09,0:11:15.50,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.80,0:11:18.04,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Came to see a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.23,0:11:20.70,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,You can’t be here. Leave immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.17,0:11:22.18,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.78,0:11:26.28,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,How dare you grab my best friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.38,0:11:32.55,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.68,0:11:34.15,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Why did you show the royal seal?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.55,0:11:36.79,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Royal Seal?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.39,0:11:38.81,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Do you want to look at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.32,0:11:47.56,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-It's a bomb!\N-Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.43,0:13:05.30,Default,Biryulka,0,0,0,,They went through all the gates of the capital?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.30,0:13:07.51,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Yes. If you order us to use guns...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.51,0:13:10.78,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Now it is more important to complete the coronation ceremony,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.78,0:13:12.07,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,we'll have to wait a while with the guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.68,0:13:15.52,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,And send guards to all gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.52,0:13:16.68,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.48,0:13:22.82,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,As soon as the ceremony is over,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.32,0:13:26.37,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I'll get rid of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.46,0:13:31.93,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,How can we continue the ceremony without the royal seal?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.23,0:13:34.73,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,God, how could this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.93,0:13:38.28,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.64,0:13:41.75,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Why are you of no use?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.66,0:13:50.76,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.35,0:13:55.39,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.39,0:13:58.35,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,We cannot attack now
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.35,0:14:00.06,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,due to unknown acrid smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.63,0:14:03.50,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,And since the ceremony must end successfully,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.50,0:14:06.73,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I sent guards to the gate to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.80,0:14:10.64,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Deceptive tactics.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.73,0:14:11.73,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.94,0:14:15.01,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.10,0:14:17.12,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I will bring the royal seal myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.52,0:14:21.48,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Immediately call all the guards back to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.15,0:14:23.81,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-What?\N-Don’t you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.68,0:14:25.72,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.54,0:14:39.93,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,It’s so quiet here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.37,0:14:43.23,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Seems like everything is going according to plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.84,0:14:48.44,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,We have come this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.05,0:14:58.12,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Are you afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.95,0:15:00.93,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Yes, me too
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.85,0:15:03.00,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,suppressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.13,0:15:05.53,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Exactly. This is how you feel
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.53,0:15:07.59,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,before the boss fight in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.63,0:15:10.83,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Correct. Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.83,0:15:13.37,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,If you die before you defeat him, you will curse everything in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.37,0:15:15.10,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,because you have to start all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.10,0:15:17.47,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,We only have one chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.20,0:15:20.05,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,God. I'm getting scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.18,0:15:27.48,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Shall we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.12,0:15:59.58,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,He got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.13,0:16:09.26,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,My queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.82,0:16:13.72,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I'm fine. The sound was frightened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.72,0:16:15.19,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,It doesn’t even hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.14,0:16:22.23,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.47,0:16:24.64,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,My queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.18,0:16:31.62,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Queen, don’t move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.88,0:16:33.81,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,We must stop the ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.81,0:16:36.35,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,You are more important.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.39,0:16:44.13,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I have to look at the wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.38,0:17:34.44,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,My king.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.33,0:18:01.56,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Am I going back?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.91,0:18:02.97,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.03,0:18:05.34,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Why now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.11,0:18:07.11,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,Please,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.54,0:18:12.32,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,after I see that he is alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.12,0:18:17.09,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Let me make sure he's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.67,0:18:38.08,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Critical state
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.42,0:18:54.75,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Is this my body? I'm back?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.48,0:18:56.66,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,What about Cheoljong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.90,0:19:07.91,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,No, I have to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.07,0:19:10.34,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.27,0:19:12.58,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,This was 200 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.29,0:19:40.50,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,VIP Department
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.64,0:19:44.14,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,What? Jang Bong Hwan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.38,0:19:47.44,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Jang Bong-hwan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.74,0:19:49.38,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Jang Bong-hwan? Patient?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.54,0:19:54.54,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.54,0:19:56.36,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,You can’t run like that! You just woke up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.36,0:19:57.71,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Jang Bong-hwan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.51,0:20:00.72,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,-Chan Bong-hwan!\N-Follow him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.22,0:20:02.43,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Jang Bong-hwan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.17,0:20:07.63,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.63,0:20:08.76,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.40,0:20:12.67,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,-Stop.\N-Why are you running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.67,0:20:13.70,Default,tier2,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.70,0:20:16.00,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Stop it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.00,0:20:19.23,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,-What?\N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.68,0:20:30.92,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Damn youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.01,0:20:34.43,Default,tyra2,0,0,0,,Was he really like a vegetable for several months?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.43,0:20:52.11,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Daehan Bookstore
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.94,0:20:54.20,Default,tira2,0,0,0,,"The True History of Joseon."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.92,0:21:05.06,Default,tira2,0,0,0,,"The True History of Joseon"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.18,0:21:11.95,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Just don’t die. You can't die like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.49,0:21:14.83,Default,tira2,0,0,0,,22nd King of Joseon State
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.03,0:21:19.64,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,King Cheol...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.91,0:21:24.31,Default,shooting2,0,0,0,,The era of the reign of King Cheoljong
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.59,0:21:38.59,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,It’s not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.06,0:21:44.66,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,He left.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.87,0:21:53.93,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.91,0:21:59.91,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.04,0:22:10.92,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,You can’t leave like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.42,0:22:13.18,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Please wake up, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.45,0:22:18.52,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.02,0:22:24.03,Default,shooting2,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.90,0:22:26.20,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.70,0:22:28.26,Default,shooting 2,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.50,0:22:31.77,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,But you are bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.27,0:22:34.04,Default,shooting2,0,0,0,,Feeling all this pain,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.00,0:22:37.08,Default,shooting2,0,0,0,,I guess I won't die from this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.18,0:22:41.98,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,These body armor saved our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.95,0:22:45.32,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,What a relief!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.29,0:23:29.73,Default,shooting2,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.73,0:23:31.73,Default,tyra2,0,0,0,,The king sided with the donghak followers?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.73,0:23:36.84,Default,tier2,0,0,0,,I guess
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.23,0:23:40.04,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,I'm still the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.04,0:23:42.27,Default,shooting2,0,0,0,,You shouldn't have done anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.12,0:23:46.35,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Accept your position and do nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.35,0:23:48.15,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,everyone would be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.56,0:23:51.59,Default,tier2,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.93,0:23:55.28,Default,tyra2,0,0,0,,relative of those you killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.86,0:24:02.29,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,I am the king of those people whom you have neglected!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.87,0:24:10.08,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Impossible to act.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.50,0:24:16.11,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,You are exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.92,0:24:19.62,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,I doubt you can dodge my sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.89,0:24:27.89,Default,tier2,0,0,0,,Your...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.26,0:24:42.03,Default,tier2,0,0,0,,No. My baby. I beg you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.43,0:24:57.10,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.10,0:26:11.19,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.07,0:26:15.13,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Live.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.84,0:26:19.60,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Life in humiliation -
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.53,0:26:22.91,Default,shooting 2,0,0,0,,your punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.62,0:26:33.24,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Try to kill yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.28,0:26:36.92,Default,shooting 2,0,0,0,,I will do everything to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.48,0:26:40.09,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,And no matter how much pain you endure,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.09,0:26:41.95,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,but I will definitely make you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.56,0:26:45.49,Default,shooting2,0,0,0,,Live like an empty shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.79,0:26:48.29,Default,shooting2,0,0,0,,Such is life
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.26,0:26:53.20,Default,shooting 2,0,0,0,,will cut deep into your bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.52,0:27:31.05,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,And what next? Hiding in the crowd is your specialty
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.55,0:27:34.52,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,but it’s curfew, and there’s not a single soul in the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.26,0:27:37.96,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,You have nowhere else to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.39,0:28:04.55,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,My queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.72,0:28:12.23,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Finish your battle first.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.73,0:28:14.90,Default,tier2,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.33,0:28:17.63,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Nothing is more important than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.27,0:28:19.60,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Don’t worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.27,0:28:22.17,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,I can handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.61,0:28:28.04,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.35,0:28:31.81,Default,tier2,0,0,0,,I will take care of the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.65,0:28:33.75,Default,shooting 2,0,0,0,,You must go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.85,0:28:35.92,Default,shooting2,0,0,0,,We don't know what else could happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.23,0:28:53.60,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Please go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.42,0:29:18.19,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,I'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.59,0:29:20.63,Default,tier2,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.07,0:29:33.07,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.51,0:29:34.54,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.74,0:29:35.94,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.80,0:30:03.00,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.67,0:30:07.94,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Why are you so useless?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.03,0:30:29.63,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Behave with dignity!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.93,0:30:33.13,Default,shooting2,0,0,0,,I'm so scared, Queen Dowager.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.64,0:30:38.01,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,You must defend your place!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.67,0:31:38.10,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Get away from the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.79,0:31:58.59,Default,shooting2,0,0,0,,The Dowager Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.79,0:32:03.83,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,I greet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.44,0:32:55.54,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Greet His Majesty the King!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.38,0:32:57.48,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,My queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.51,0:33:01.22,Default,shooting2,0,0,0,,Her Majesty is now unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.05,0:33:06.35,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.92,0:33:09.36,Default,tira2,0,0,0,,Her Majesty may be having a miscarriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.39,0:33:12.36,Default,tier2,0,0,0,,This is a little bleeding now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.66,0:33:16.03,Default,tyra2,0,0,0,,But if it continues, both the queen and her child
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.90,0:33:19.33,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,will not survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.37,0:33:25.81,Default,shooting2,0,0,0,,Then why are you removing the needles?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.24,0:33:31.68,Default,tira2,0,0,0,,Now acupuncture will only harm her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.31,0:33:35.32,Default,tyra2,0,0,0,,All we can do is wait and pray for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.25,0:33:39.72,Default,shooting 2,0,0,0,,She may not last long.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.56,0:33:47.73,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty! No!\N-Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.64,0:33:55.84,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, forgive us,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.81,0:33:59.54,Default,tier2,0,0,0,,but leave the room so we can take care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.11,0:34:02.88,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, we must leave them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.28,0:34:09.45,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.09,0:34:13.35,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.92,0:34:19.13,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,There is nothing I can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.44,0:35:10.55,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,My queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.93,0:35:27.96,Default,tyra2,0,0,0,,The Queen and the child are fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.77,0:35:37.81,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.64,0:35:43.75,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,I'm so happy. You and our baby...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.88,0:35:48.92,Default,shooting2,0,0,0,,Everything is fine with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.53,0:35:59.53,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.08,0:36:19.85,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,This is the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.08,0:36:25.55,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Who knew that the king was so extraordinary?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.29,0:36:29.09,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.39,0:36:35.70,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,How dare you shout so loudly? Where are your manners?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.03,0:36:37.07,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,This is the case here,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.90,0:36:41.44,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,the king gave the order for your movement to the Western Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.64,0:36:42.70,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.84,0:36:46.31,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,How dare he send me to the Western Palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.01,0:36:50.14,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Who does he take me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.25,0:36:59.32,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Open the door now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.82,0:37:02.62,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,I can’t open the door, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.60,0:37:15.67,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Open this door immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.60,0:37:19.04,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,The Queen has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.03,0:37:44.07,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.94,0:37:57.58,Default,shooting2,0,0,0,,I heard that yesterday you were on the verge,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.58,0:37:58.95,Default,tier2,0,0,0,,but everything seems to be fine with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.21,0:38:01.28,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,All thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.65,0:38:04.25,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.25,0:38:07.59,Default,shooting2,0,0,0,,Since when do I have to tell you my location?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.59,0:38:10.49,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,It was decided to send you to the Western Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.96,0:38:13.26,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Until then, stay in Dongmyeongjong.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.63,0:38:15.46,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,You are not allowed to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.10,0:38:19.73,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Are you saying you're locking me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.77,0:38:22.40,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Don’t make me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.51,0:38:25.57,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.97,0:38:28.51,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,You cannot exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.24,0:38:31.21,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,I told you to get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.92,0:38:35.15,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,The Dowager Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.12,0:38:42.09,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Your last day will be spent in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.49,0:38:46.59,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Court lady Chon, why are you standing?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.59,0:38:47.70,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.47,0:38:54.44,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.44,0:38:56.44,Default,tier2,0,0,0,,They no longer obey you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.57,0:39:00.27,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Responsible for the courtyard
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.18,0:39:02.21,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,now I.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.78,0:39:04.38,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,I am in charge of the yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.55,0:39:06.61,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,I'm still here!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.61,0:39:08.55,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,This is my place!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.55,0:39:10.59,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,From this day on, everything will change,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.25,0:39:13.19,Default,tyra2,0,0,0,,especially the rules of etiquette,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.19,0:39:15.12,Default,tier2,0,0,0,,set by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.32,0:39:18.93,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,They have existed for thousands of years!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.29,0:39:22.56,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Do you think you can give them up overnight?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.66,0:39:25.43,Default,tier2,0,0,0,,They are already weakening.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.30,0:39:28.04,Default,shooting2,0,0,0,,The changes you were so afraid of,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.14,0:39:30.71,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,already started.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.85,0:39:49.66,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Damn, how refreshing!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.03,0:39:52.06,Default,tier2,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.79,0:39:55.93,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Court Lady Choi, what did I just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.60,0:39:59.57,Default,shooting2,0,0,0,,"Damn, how refreshing!" -
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.27,0:40:01.80,Default,shooting2,0,0,0,,that's what you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.17,0:40:08.08,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Apparently, my hidden instincts have awakened.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.88,0:40:10.58,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,This is really refreshing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.78,0:40:13.68,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,I can’t stop, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.02,0:40:17.05,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.69,0:40:19.89,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.72,0:40:24.76,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,To you! Scoundrels!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.63,0:40:27.66,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.50,0:40:33.80,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.95,0:40:49.52,Default,tira2,0,0,0,,"Queen Mother of the Cho Family,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.52,0:40:51.52,Default,tyra2,0,0,0,,guilty of spreading rumors,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.72,0:40:53.42,Default,tyra2,0,0,0,,who discredited the name of the queen
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.62,0:40:55.36,Default,tyra2,0,0,0,,and disgraced the royal family,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.26,0:40:58.36,Default,shooting2,0,0,0,,as punishment for sowing unrest in the country
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.36,0:41:01.16,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,will be exiled to the Western Palace."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.30,0:41:05.30,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,This is another conspiracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.27,0:41:09.47,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,I didn’t do anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.47,0:41:12.47,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Are you telling the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.91,0:41:17.21,Default,shooting2,0,0,0,,I swear on the honor of the late king.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.58,0:41:20.75,Default,shooting2,0,0,0,,I didn’t do anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.72,0:41:25.82,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.14,0:41:48.71,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,"The property of the following criminals will be confiscated,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.01,0:41:50.38,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,and they themselves will be flogged 100 times
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.38,0:41:52.11,Default,tyra2,0,0,0,,and will be sent as slaves to Jeju Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.31,0:41:54.85,Default,tyra2,0,0,0,,Their children and wives will not be punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.25,0:41:58.02,Default,tira2,0,0,0,,Former State Councilor Kim Byung-hak,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.49,0:42:00.02,Default,tyra2,0,0,0,,former right adviser Cho Man-heon,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.45,0:42:02.19,Default,tyra2,0,0,0,,former left adviser Kim Seok-keun,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.19,0:42:03.96,Default,tira2,0,0,0,,former Minister of War Kim Chang-hyuk,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.43,0:42:06.13,Default,tira2,0,0,0,,former chief secretary Kim Soheun,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.49,0:42:08.20,Default,tyra2,0,0,0,,former Minister of Officials Jo Dong-mun
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.80,0:42:10.13,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,and others from this list
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.13,0:42:11.87,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,will not be executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.87,0:42:13.53,Default,shooting gallery2,0,0,0,,Their property will be confiscated.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.53,0:42:15.87,Default,tyra2,0,0,0,,Their term of imprisonment will be 3 years."
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.74,0:42:20.11,Default,shooting2,0,0,0,,-Have mercy, Your Majesty.\N-Have mercy, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.28,0:42:23.28,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,We had no choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.74,0:42:26.41,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Kim Byungin threatened us!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.41,0:42:29.62,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,To our minds
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.15,0:42:33.82,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,it never occurred to me to plot treason!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.19,0:42:36.96,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Spare us, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.12,0:42:38.89,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Everything is so, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.89,0:42:41.16,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Our only fault is,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.16,0:42:44.07,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,that we believed the news of your death.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.37,0:42:47.54,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Our gullibility is our sin!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.60,0:42:49.70,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.61,0:42:53.57,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Then I'll tell you what else you've done wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.41,0:42:59.68,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,In Joseon
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.18,0:43:03.32,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,those whose wallets are full of coins are to blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.05,0:43:07.36,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Are any of you poor?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.09,0:43:12.56,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Forcing the common people to work\Nuntil exhaustion, you filled your bellies.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.96,0:43:15.06,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,You forgot that your main task is
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.06,0:43:16.80,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,do everything for the sake of the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.03,0:43:19.80,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,You imagine yourself above this,\Nyou don’t care about your debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.33,0:43:22.10,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Ordinary people were forced
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.10,0:43:24.14,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,plow mountainous terrain.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.51,0:43:26.84,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,And you kept raising and raising taxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.68,0:43:30.85,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,While you lived in luxury and knew no troubles,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.85,0:43:33.55,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,the people of Joseon perished day and night
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.55,0:43:34.98,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,from poverty and hunger.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.32,0:43:36.88,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,How to earn more?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.88,0:43:38.35,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,How to get higher?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.35,0:43:39.89,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,How to become more influential?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.89,0:43:41.29,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Have you thought about this,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.29,0:43:43.76,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,not the suffering of my people!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.33,0:43:45.93,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,You don’t care about him!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.23,0:43:49.36,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,People's lives were full of torment.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.03,0:43:54.70,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Your first sin is,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.70,0:43:57.57,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,that you imagine that your life is more valuable than theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.14,0:43:59.54,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Your second sin is that you
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.54,0:44:01.91,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,they mocked people,\Ntaking away any hope for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.41,0:44:04.55,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,The despair of the fathers, because they are powerless,\Nthe desperation of the king,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.55,0:44:06.51,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,because it is useless for the country,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.51,0:44:08.58,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,here is your third sin!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.38,0:44:12.39,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,If they slander you,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.89,0:44:15.16,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,come forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.16,0:44:23.66,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Remember your sins.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.57,0:44:26.73,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Repent.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.87,0:44:29.20,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,You are just
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.74,0:44:32.91,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,unscrupulous thieves.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.34,0:44:35.28,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,But of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.32,0:44:43.22,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,-Creature!\N-Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.22,0:44:46.42,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,-Beast!\N-Tear it into pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.42,0:44:48.19,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,-Die!\N-Creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.19,0:44:49.59,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,-Bastard!\N-Punish him!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.59,0:44:52.19,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,-Die!\N-Creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.19,0:44:53.53,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,-So you!\N-Pay for your sins!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.53,0:44:56.36,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,-You deserve to die!\N-What a bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.36,0:44:58.50,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,-Serves you right!\N-Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.96,0:45:23.62,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Just leave it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.53,0:45:26.46,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,But you always wear makeup.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.46,0:45:29.53,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,I know you are forbidden to leave the Western Palace
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.53,0:45:31.50,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,or meet someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.77,0:45:32.97,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,But still...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.50,0:45:38.84,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,I kept you with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.61,0:45:42.21,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,because you are a brainless chatterbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.74,0:45:45.38,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,You are not one of those who can secretly plan something.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.08,0:45:48.22,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.38,0:45:52.65,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,We all live our lives differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.82,0:45:53.89,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.19,0:45:57.89,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,why aren’t you yelling at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.63,0:46:02.73,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,I never learned to keep my mouth shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.40,0:46:08.07,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Even if I’m not crying,\Nwhy are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.50,0:46:10.07,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.68,0:46:22.68,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,I will survive everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.79,0:46:30.42,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Survive for me -
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.69,0:46:33.99,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,means win.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.88,0:47:30.58,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Hold my hand until we get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.19,0:47:32.22,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,What are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.29,0:47:33.55,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,If there are her memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.02,0:47:38.29,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,so Soyeon is still inside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.66,0:47:44.13,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,You found me again, Benin.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.67,0:47:48.77,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,And I hid so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.08,0:48:35.52,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,-Sorry, queen.\N-Sorry, queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.48,0:48:38.89,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Glad to hear you're having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.56,0:48:43.02,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,-Sorry, queen.\N-Sorry, queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.56,0:48:50.63,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,You have changed so much, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.17,0:48:54.64,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,After the wedding, I wasn’t myself, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.50,0:48:57.61,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,All because,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.74,0:49:02.81,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,that this title\Nbecame a great test for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.81,0:49:07.25,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,You have changed even before your wedding, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.69,0:49:18.13,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Then I thought that the only way out was
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.86,0:49:22.00,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,this is death.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.51,0:49:44.89,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,I shouldn’t have gotten here\NJang Bong-hwan
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.89,0:49:49.09,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Did you get home without any problems?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.73,0:50:00.53,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.40,0:50:05.04,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,-Dad!\N-No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.47,0:50:07.34,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,It’s hard for you to walk, stay still!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.61,0:50:09.78,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,I'll come up myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.82,0:50:16.58,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,-How are you feeling?\N-How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.95,0:50:19.65,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Speak first, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.65,0:50:21.79,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Everything is fine! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.56,0:50:23.82,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,-I'm fine.\N-I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.36,0:50:31.67,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.67,0:50:33.17,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.17,0:50:34.80,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,I live on your prayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.20,0:50:36.84,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,When during the ceremony
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.84,0:50:38.44,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,the rebels broke through the gate,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.44,0:50:40.97,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,all the nobles were horrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.24,0:50:44.88,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,But the villagers came to my house to protect us.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.31,0:50:47.25,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,They said I was a kind person
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.25,0:50:49.15,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,and helped them a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.05,0:50:54.29,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,I was just following your instructions,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.52,0:50:57.16,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,so I'm very embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.83,0:51:00.83,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,From now on, you yourself can be kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.99,0:51:02.90,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.86,0:51:06.07,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,I will be a respected grandfather
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.07,0:51:08.34,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,for your child.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.11,0:51:13.34,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Oh, the baby is pushing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.31,0:51:15.84,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Already pushing?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.52,0:51:24.19,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,My granddaughter will be a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.10,0:51:36.24,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Maybe the onion smells too strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.58,0:51:39.12,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,What are you cooking so enthusiastically?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.72,0:51:44.45,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,I wanted to try to repeat the ramen,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.45,0:51:45.78,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,which the queen was preparing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.66,0:51:51.35,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Can I have some ramen?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.41,0:52:05.87,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.08,0:52:11.37,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,I thought we would win and life would begin,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.05,0:52:13.22,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,and even more work.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.72,0:52:16.01,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,No one.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.64,0:52:18.89,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Hon Duil!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.89,0:52:20.58,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,I'm busy! Then we'll play!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.76,0:52:23.45,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,I'm tired of gambling.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.95,0:52:26.03,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.62,0:52:32.87,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,For my contribution to the victory
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.87,0:52:36.43,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,the king granted me a position at court.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.93,0:52:39.01,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,And here I am
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.74,0:52:41.64,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,remained in the same post.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.85,0:52:44.74,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Ask for the position of minister?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.49,0:52:56.16,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,What is that monster on your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.28,0:52:59.49,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,How old-fashioned you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.53,0:53:06.39,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,I now serve in the department of external relations.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.80,0:53:11.07,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,For such a talented person\NJoseon alone will not be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.58,0:53:20.97,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Congratulations on quitting gaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.51,0:53:22.64,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,What about the purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.64,0:53:24.35,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Congratulate you on what you will
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.35,0:53:26.05,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,walk until you wear out your legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.18,0:53:32.93,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,I'm still in shock that Lee Senman is our queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.93,0:53:35.87,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,And I’m still in shock that you didn’t get it right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.10,0:53:38.43,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Duil, you're already done...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.87,0:53:41.87,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Oh! And you are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.01,0:53:45.03,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Long time no see, Jeong Chul!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.85,0:53:50.87,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,If Lee Senman is the queen, then you...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.41,0:53:59.32,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,You are a woman too.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.33,0:54:03.05,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,Kim Hwan, I adore you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.45,0:54:04.85,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,You are so smart!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.39,0:54:10.07,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,I heard that you were given a post at court.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.62,0:54:12.37,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,The king himself gave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.53,0:54:15.91,Default,pineapple 3,0,0,0,,For what are my sins?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.41,0:54:26.32,Default,li,0,0,0,,-Samvol, go into the house.\N-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.82,0:54:31.91,Default,li,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.16,0:54:34.78,Default,li,0,0,0,,It’s cold outside. How long did you wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.78,0:54:37.39,Default,or,0,0,0,,No. I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.89,0:54:41.12,Default,li,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.03,0:54:51.47,Default,or,0,0,0,,Just a cramp.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.95,0:54:57.58,Default,li,0,0,0,,How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.01,0:55:00.01,Default,li,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.62,0:55:02.55,Default,li,0,0,0,,His Majesty is all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.55,0:55:03.55,Default,or,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.68,0:55:05.99,Default,li,0,0,0,,I was asking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.28,0:55:10.43,Default,li,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.74,0:55:26.24,Default,li,0,0,0,,The situation with the Ijeongcheon Department has stabilized.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.43,0:55:28.64,Default,li,0,0,0,,Thanks to him, I'm swamped with work.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.14,0:55:33.97,Default,li,0,0,0,,So, what's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.32,0:55:35.39,Default,li,0,0,0,,I want
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.45,0:55:39.16,Default,whether,0,0,0,,give power to every person,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.82,0:55:42.12,Default,or,0,0,0,,so that when people gather, they have more power than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.85,0:55:46.70,Default,or,0,0,0,,This way corrupt officials will no longer be able to exploit them.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.39,0:55:49.89,Default,li,0,0,0,,I believe this is how it should end
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.80,0:55:53.49,Default,li,0,0,0,,this is a difficult battle
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.64,0:55:56.07,Default,li,0,0,0,,and a wonderful journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.74,0:55:58.87,Default,li,0,0,0,,You want to say that I have more worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.87,0:56:00.74,Default,li,0,0,0,,Let's end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.74,0:56:02.30,Default,li,0,0,0,,Oh my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.08,0:56:07.01,Default,li,0,0,0,,Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.01,0:56:08.74,Default,or,0,0,0,,You can continue tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.45,0:56:10.99,Default,li,0,0,0,,We won't get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.16,0:56:14.55,Default,li,0,0,0,,First, put things in order...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.72,0:56:16.22,Default,li,0,0,0,,-Good night.\N-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.39,0:56:20.10,Default,li,0,0,0,,Duil, you need to create...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.35,0:56:21.39,Default,li,0,0,0,,Duil!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.72,0:56:23.66,Default,li,0,0,0,,What a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.51,0:56:50.26,Default,li,0,0,0,,Queen's Dictionary
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.33,0:57:01.53,Default,or,0,0,0,,Am I missing something?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.97,0:57:06.91,Default,li,0,0,0,,Sometimes I feel like...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.37,0:57:11.51,Default,li,0,0,0,,He did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.22,0:57:13.41,Default,li,0,0,0,,He succeeded.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.41,0:57:14.45,Default,li,0,0,0,,The era of the reign of King Cheoljo
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.26,0:57:30.99,Default,li,0,0,0,,Chronicles of King Cheoljo
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.20,0:57:36.20,Default,li,0,0,0,,My queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.14,0:57:42.45,Default,or,0,0,0,,Not funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.12,0:58:05.20,Default,lee,0,0,0,,Jang Bong-hwan!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.64,0:58:10.70,Default,li,0,0,0,,Don’t come near.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.93,0:58:14.68,Default,li,0,0,0,,You need to find Khan first.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.08,0:58:17.74,Default,is it,0,0,0,,No, is it faster to immediately contact the media?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.64,0:58:21.64,Default,li,0,0,0,,Why are you running away? He did such a good deed!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.89,0:58:23.95,Default,or,0,0,0,,Good deed?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.41,0:58:27.45,Default,li,0,0,0,,Then why are you following me?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.08,0:58:29.45,Default,or,0,0,0,,We are protecting you because
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.45,0:58:31.22,Default,or,0,0,0,,you gave a tip for the public good.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.55,0:58:32.55,Default,is it,0,0,0,,Good?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.55,0:58:35.87,Default,li,0,0,0,,Remember the camera in the warehouse?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.87,0:58:37.62,Default,li,0,0,0,,You repaired it in secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.10,0:58:39.16,Default,li,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.93,0:58:46.93,Default,li,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.18,0:58:56.99,Default,or,0,0,0,,Do you control the camera?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.91,0:58:59.95,Default,li,0,0,0,,It's strange that it's still broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.35,0:59:01.55,Default,li,0,0,0,,We need to catch the thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.18,0:59:05.16,Default,li,0,0,0,,Why are you doing nonsense?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.45,0:59:06.85,Default,li,0,0,0,,That doesn’t sound like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.85,0:59:09.66,Default,or,0,0,0,,Exactly. Why didn't they tell me earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.26,0:59:11.80,Default,li,0,0,0,,I've already done things.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.57,0:59:14.14,Default,li,0,0,0,,-What?\N-I sent the camera footage
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.14,0:59:17.24,Default,or,0,0,0,,free in the media, which is unusual for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.43,0:59:21.47,Default,li,0,0,0,,He's lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.85,0:59:22.95,Default,li,0,0,0,,Yes, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.45,0:59:26.78,Default,lee,0,0,0,,The Bonghwan I knew doesn't care about justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.78,0:59:28.62,Default,li,0,0,0,,He would have come to me first
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.62,0:59:32.05,Default,or,0,0,0,,and agreed before sending records. Am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.22,0:59:35.22,Default,or,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.18,0:59:37.43,Default,li,0,0,0,,I’m such a scoundrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.20,0:59:39.22,Default,li,0,0,0,,But you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.49,0:59:42.33,Default,li,0,0,0,,-I have changed.\N-Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.16,0:59:44.62,Default,whether,0,0,0,,-Why?\N-I don’t know.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.33,0:59:46.57,Default,li,0,0,0,,I just wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.87,0:59:52.08,Default,li,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.45,0:59:59.47,Default,lee,0,0,0,,Chief Poo!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.12,1:00:02.18,Default,li,0,0,0,,Chief Poo!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.32,1:00:06.68,Default,li,0,0,0,,-Damn.\N-Moron.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.26,1:00:19.97,Default,li,0,0,0,,Cheoljong managed to change his fate,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.26,1:00:21.47,Default,li,0,0,0,,and I have changed too.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.30,1:00:25.10,Default,li,0,0,0,,But why is Director Han still the same?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.35,1:00:30.78,Default,or,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.91,1:00:34.82,Default,li,0,0,0,,Choljo
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.91,1:00:38.85,Default,li,0,0,0,,Has the world really not changed at all?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.49,1:00:41.66,Default,is it,0,0,0,,Only me and Cheoljong have changed?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.76,1:00:44.72,Default,lee,0,0,0,,Choljo's achievements
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.72,1:00:46.70,Default,lee,0,0,0,,Cholzhdo's charisma shook Joseon to the core
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.70,1:00:48.72,Default,li,0,0,0,,Choljo carried out people's reform
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.72,1:00:51.10,Default,li,0,0,0,,Achievements of King Cheoljo and Queen Chhorin
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.10,1:00:52.66,Default,li,0,0,0,,Served as a model for reforming kings
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.66,1:00:55.03,Default,li,0,0,0,,Choljo laid the foundation for democracy
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.26,1:00:59.30,Default,li,0,0,0,,-Comment.\N-Say a few words!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.30,1:01:01.47,Default,li,0,0,0,,-Just a few words!\N-Do you admit the charges?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.47,1:01:03.45,Default,li,0,0,0,,-Here!\N-Comment!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.45,1:01:05.87,Default,is it true?\N-Do you admit the charges?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.87,1:01:08.12,Default,is,0,0,0,,-Are all statements true?\N-Is this true?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.12,1:01:14.16,Default,whether,0,0,0,,Director Han has been embezzling funds for many years
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.05,1:01:19.53,Default,or,0,0,0,,Times are changing.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.53,1:01:23.20,Default,li,0,0,0,,But insidious corrupt officials always survive.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.26,1:01:27.87,Default,li,0,0,0,,Even though there are rotten parts in the world,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.87,1:01:30.60,Default,or,0,0,0,,but it allows you to cut out these rotten segments.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.10,1:01:34.64,Default,or,0,0,0,,If you try to change your life for the better,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.64,1:01:36.51,Default,li,0,0,0,,you will succeed,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.55,1:01:39.68,Default,li,0,0,0,,like me and Cheoljong.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.99,1:02:01.03,Default,li,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-What?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.03,1:02:02.33,Default,or,0,0,0,,Turn over.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.10,1:02:04.14,Default,or,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.20,1:02:12.22,Default,or,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, is it difficult for you to concentrate?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.74,1:02:14.85,Default,li,0,0,0,,I want to see the queen so bad,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.49,1:02:17.01,Default,or,0,0,0,,that I can’t think of anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.51,1:02:21.66,Default,or,0,0,0,,This won’t work.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.33,1:02:24.68,Default,li,0,0,0,,I'll see the queen and then take care of business.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.39,1:02:27.39,Default,or,0,0,0,,Next.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.33,1:02:30.70,Default,li,0,0,0,,All women of the court over 18
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.74,1:02:33.26,Default,whether,0,0,0,,marriage is allowed.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.30,1:02:40.30,Default,or,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.30,1:02:43.28,Default,or,0,0,0,,Additionally, children under 10 years old
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.28,1:02:45.47,Default,or,0,0,0,,should not be courtyard servants.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.87,1:02:48.99,Default,li,0,0,0,,And more...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.89,1:02:55.26,Default,li,0,0,0,,What next, Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.35,1:03:00.39,Default,is it,0,0,0,,Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.26,1:03:04.53,Default,lee,0,0,0,,Sorry, Lady Choi.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.53,1:03:07.37,Default,li,0,0,0,,You find it difficult to concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.66,1:03:10.03,Default,li,0,0,0,,You recently met His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.64,1:03:12.53,Default,li,0,0,0,,It's not me. It's the child who misses him.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.24,1:03:14.58,Default,or,0,0,0,,For the well-being of the child,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.87,1:03:18.20,Default,would you,0,0,0,,go and see the king for a while?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.55,1:03:19.68,Default,or,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.55,1:03:25.62,Default,li,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-What?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.62,1:03:28.93,Default,li,0,0,0,,Her Majesty headed to the Songjeongjong Hall.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.85,1:03:32.35,Default,or,0,0,0,,Wow. We missed each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.30,1:03:36.93,Default,is,0,0,0,,His Majesty in Daejojon?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.22,1:03:38.26,Default,li,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.87,1:03:47.87,Default,li,0,0,0,,Wait, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.60,1:03:50.85,Default,li,0,0,0,,How excited she is. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.68,1:04:01.32,Default,li,0,0,0,,What is it. Have we missed each other again?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.39,1:04:05.45,Default,or,0,0,0,,Lord, are we playing hide and seek?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.49,1:04:14.60,Default,or,0,0,0,,This won’t work.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.64,1:04:16.74,Default,li,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.39,1:04:31.89,Default,li,0,0,0,,We have finally met.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.41,1:04:33.45,Default,or,0,0,0,,After,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.43,1:04:37.39,Default,or,0,0,0,,how many times we missed each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.89,1:04:42.39,Default,li,0,0,0,,These fleeting moments seemed like an eternity.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.35,1:05:18.39,Default,li,0,0,0,,By the way, why are you talking to me so formally?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.03,1:05:21.20,Default,are you,0,0,0,,Are you preparing some kind of surprise again?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.33,1:06:18.04,Default,li,0,0,0,,Thanks for watching with Azaleas
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.77,1:06:20.60,Default,lee,0,0,0,,Special thanks to Choi Jinhyuk
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.72,0:20:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,

Comment: 0,0:13:13.63,0:13:15.18,Default,Biryulka,0,0,0,,Deceptive tactics: distract from the east and attack from the west.
Comment: 0,0:59:43.56,0:59:44.66,Default,li,0,0,0,,Authentic Records of the Joseon Dynasty
Comment: 0,1:04:51.30,1:04:55.57,Default,li,0,0,0,,Queen Chorin
